OL,3,GNEWSACancer survivors' support centre  
OL,4,Ahelping hundreds a month               
OL,6,FThree breast cancer survivors who vowed
OL,7,Fto improve cancer services for people  
OL,8,Fon the Isle of Man say they are happy  
OL,9,Ftheir newly built information and      
OL,10,Fsupport centre is seeing hundreds of   
OL,11,Fpeople each week.                      
OL,13,FThe Mannin Cancer Help Centre, located 
OL,14,Fopposite the entrance to Noble's       
OL,15,FHospital, was opened earlier this year 
OL,16,Fby Julie Stokes, Karen Wagstaffe and   
OL,17,FAnne Dawd.                             
OL,19,FThe trio met in 2009 during treatment  
OL,20,Fand quickly came to learn there was    
OL,21,Flittle to no support services available
OL,22,Ffor people with cancer.                
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
